  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/separatedleaves/title.png\" alt=\"Separated Leaves 標題\"></p><h3>Separated Leaves 是一款伺服器端、資料驅動的模組，正如你所猜測的，它讓樹葉與原木分離。</h3><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/architectury-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Architectury API\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric API\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a></p><hr><p>這個模組讓樹葉只與其對應的原木種類相連。這意味著，例如，當你砍掉一棵緊鄰白樺樹的橡樹時，所有橡樹葉都會消失，即使它們原本與白樺樹相連。</p><p><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/separatedleaves/showcase.gif\" alt=\"\"></p><p>這在裝飾樹場時也非常有用，因為你可以在建築中使用任何其他原木種類，而不用擔心樹葉會附著在你的牆上。</p><h3>本模組完全是資料驅動的！</h3><p>這意味著你可以透過資料包自行為任何模組添加相容性。<br>\n想了解怎麼做嗎？請參閱<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.teamdiopside.nl%252fseparated-leaves%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">文件</a>。</p><h3>內建相容性模組列表：</h3><ul>\n<li>Atmospheric</li>\n<li>Autumnity</li>\n<li>Biomes o' Plenty</li>\n<li>Ecologics</li>\n<li>Environmental</li>\n<li>Hex Casting</li>\n<li>Malum</li>\n<li>Oh The Biomes You'll Go</li>\n<li>Premium Wood</li>\n<li>Quark</li>\n<li>Regions Unexplored</li>\n<li>The Twilight Forest</li>\n<li>Upgrade Aquatic</li>\n<li>Windswept</li>\n</ul><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fteamdiopside.nl%252fdiscord%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/diopside/Serverbanner.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>",
